COMMENT ON COLUMN inference_runs.point_count IS 'Count of observed points used in fit (measured).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN inference_runs.theoretical_log_log_slope IS 'Fixed-point slope for the system.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN inference_runs.fitted_slope IS 'Estimated slope from observed data under FitMethod.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN inference_runs.fitted_intercept IS 'Estimated intercept in log10 space (logMeasure = intercept + slope*logScale).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN inference_runs.slope_delta IS 'Difference between fitted slope and fixed-point slope.';
